OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad meets senior health
OL,4,Abosses over maternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose son was stillborn has met
OL,7,Fwith NHS bosses to see what
OL,8,Fimprovements are being made at the
OL,9,Fhospital trust that oversaw the
OL,10,Ffamily's care.
OL,12,FTom and Ewa Hender's son Aubrey was
OL,13,Fdelivered in 2022 at the former City
OL,14,FHospital - now Midland Metropolitan
OL,15,FUniversity Hospital - run by Sandwell
OL,16,Fand West Birmingham NHS Trust (SWBH).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
