OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad meets senior health
OL,4,Abosses over maternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple have been critical of the
OL,7,Fcare they received, with their account
OL,8,Fforming part of a review, led by
OL,9,FBaroness Amos and published in June,
OL,10,Fwhich raised concerns about the safety
OL,11,Fof women and babies at the trust,
OL,12,Fexternal, citing heavy staff workloads
OL,13,Fand shortages, with patients
OL,14,Fconsistently experiencing
OL,15,Fdiscrimination and inconsistency in
OL,16,Fcare.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
